Skill: Make Telemetry & Health Fully Real

You will:
1. Define or update DB schema/models for:
   - System metrics (CPU, memory, latency, errors, etc. or domain-specific health).
   - Event logs / audit trails if relevant.
2. Implement:
   - Backend endpoints to read/write telemetry.
   - Any background jobs or instrumentation needed to populate real metrics.
3. Update frontend:
   - Replace static charts/tables with API-driven components.
   - Add loading/empty/error states.
4. Verify:
   - No hardcoded percentages, uptimes, or health scores remain.
   - All displayed metrics come from DB/API or uploaded data.
